 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZmuZ80fs2YQ7kNvwGMscF8&_nc_oc=Ado5Fl5cc0JPE3-rSf2V8IcpveGn8to9zW6vOa2reTOg4xAlMxhi-pOwjw-YKnJxlM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDaAHcSvgUFygnOtf03PPO_0v_woe9n0V7bdenHLD74ug&oe=6A5CC29E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l5LlWLQqJtkQ7kNvwEDLXp0&_nc_oc=AdoL_HgntVgAVeSLFbMAXfoetUXQm3ZaTl518F7SK_Povfv39Eqfwyr1pJU7m7ZY8rY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBHyrvBpCeU5Ap_2Ui1xhGrd-2SP6brQpdXzW2Byv-iew&oe=6A5CE041"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aV7YSCxBWcgQ7kNvwF_yCgl&_nc_oc=AdoR0wdiTyCXBbyKdBSIpHAcARRb7U8OsQTtKn7oz3QFBF8eBOkEqAjMEC6000aNIWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDeNH_cKRPWWOryesTV6dIJFVStfnbMD4A5hf7eZfzZRg&oe=6A5CBCFE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=soWxbccK8-UQ7kNvwEoyrNP&_nc_oc=AdoeI_YNK6uIh7wDsE1fAC77m0tk1i2a7dj8lNcTlpaEyprX7Ak4IhBTEP17YSAie4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDZRrtZkxTQ99gnN6Ab0Aej5oM7fcXZg5Trky8X4eU6wg&oe=6A5CC123"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zvDs_N84RaMQ7kNvwHmaFRJ&_nc_oc=Ado1PduvpY4eQmQEWVGtRd_sHU4oscSfEBCPIG-59OCir8r1eZJ3PaqD-g_womZx4so&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCunn4WitDYl4KXRay-nVJ-CpTb_y4D9E1SKL1tSHD9ZQ&oe=6A5CC73B"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con